OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 MAR
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GFrom St Michael's Church, Barnes,
OL,6,     GLondon, with the choir of Tiffin
OL,7,     GSchool and music by Oliver Tarney
OL,8,     Gand Howells.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,10,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,11,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,12,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,13,     GToday, antagonising censors, two
OL,14,     Gtragic losses and the writing of
OL,15,     Ghis most iconic scene.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GThe Elmore Quartet and Vista
OL,18,     GQuartet perform live ahead of
OL,19,     Gtheir performance at the
OL,20,     GGuildhall Chamber Festival. Also,
OL,21,     GMichael Waldron talks to Katie
OL,22,     GDerham about Britten and Oldham.
